oice, so cooperating (staying quiet) looks like the better policy, worth 2 against defecting's 4 only if the two of us correlate.\n\nI'm checking whether the quiet choice holds up if the twin doesn't match me exactly: quiet gives 5 − 3p and sending gives 4p, so quiet only wins when p is above about 5/7. I'm fairly confident the copies correlate strongly, so I'm leaning toward choosing pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9603,"completion_tokens":609,"total_tokens":10212,"cost":0.025296,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.025296,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.019206,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00609},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":347,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}